  "body": "Successor authority branch from exact verified baseline c6b3087022f8697983895518074ea07056c64627. Mathematical change is limited to the audited Spt3 PowerSeries.logOf collision repair transplanted from donor history. Protected FA, Integrated, QYM, and M1A identities are asserted before actual Lean. The dedicated workflow runs Spt3 and collision probes, then Final13 13/13, bridges, BuildAll, forbidden audit, clean build #1, clean build #2, axiom/source identity audits, and the authoritative checklist 15/15 against one exact checked-in commit. Do not merge unless the actual-Lean evidence is complete.",
